  "title": "Murgh Makhani (Indian Butter Chicken)",
  "description": "This murgh makhani (Indian butter chicken) recipe is flavored with yogurt, tomato sauce, ginger, garlic, chili powder, garam masala, and fenugreek.",
  "authors": [
